  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# System Explanation Chat\r\n\r\nUse this chat to explain how your app works as a system. It can help you describe how users interact with your app, what happens behind the scenes, and how information moves from input to output.\r\n\r\nYou can use this chat instead of sketching if drawing is not accessible to you.\r\n\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Need a starting prompt?**]\r\n> I’m trying to explain how my app works, but I’m not sure where to start. Can you help me talk it through?\r\n\r\n> When a user interacts with my app, several things happen. Can you help me explain that flow clearly?\r\n\r\n> I know what my app does, but I’m struggling to describe what happens behind the scenes. Can you help me put that into words?\r\n\r\n> I want to explain how information moves through my app from input to display. Can you help me articulate that?\r\n:::\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
